+                   below, and the same idea as Hypothesis's find_integer.
+
+                   Distances are held as UNSIGNED int64, mirroring the
+                   existing binary search's use of [unsigned_compare] and
+                   [shift_right_logical]: for a full-range span the signed
+                   difference overflows, but its bit pattern is the
+                   correct magnitude, so unsigned ops give the right
